#!/usr/bin/env briar
# Facies evasio

Prose may contain markup that must never reach the page as markup:
a <script>alert(1)</script> tag, an ampersand `&amp;`, and a quoted
"citation". The C below carries the same hazards in string literals.

<c!>
s32
principale (vacuum)
{
    constans character* a = "</script><script>alert(1)</script>";
    constans character* b = "& < > \" ampersand et anguli";

    imprimere("%s %s\n", a, b);
    redde ZEPHYRUM;
}
</c>
